            "review_id": "REV_24075827_p1_0",
            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Hidden House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Katt P\nGothenburg, Sweden29 contributions\n0\nExcellent food with a great vibe and air conditioning! Highly recommend.\nSep 2024 • Couples\nWow! This place has such a great vibe with delicious food, excellent staff and lovely music. Definitely have the Fried rice with garlic, the Pumpkin stewed with pork and the Barramundi Chardonnay. Big portions. The Pumpkin Stewed with Pork is big enough for at least two people. Complete with air-conditioning and a cozy beer garden, we highly recommend this little gem in District 1!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nVERY reasonably priced meals with big portions and a cheap lunch menu.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 13, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
